# text = It is easy for Ms Hogg, in her London retreat, to pontificate, but could she live amongst our Tamil fellow citizens who have now got to offer one member of each family to the relentless LTTE war machine, if she had been present when Tamil groups not associated with the LTTE were decimated on the last occasion the LTTE and the UNP worked together, she would think twice about what she is trying to achieve.
